{
  "id": "PHP.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "PHP",
  "reference": "Jofilipi 2",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PHP 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bwonirok pa Kristo kodi dwoŋ pere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kwo mewin i Kristo nyalo medo win miseni, kosa mar pere nyalo dwoko cuny win, kosa winyalo riwirok i Cuny, kosa winitie gi wor kodi cwako jowoti win, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "onyo sangala win an munyo wibedo gi paro acel, gi mar acel, kareno wibedo acel i cuny win kodi i paro mewin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri witim gimoro munyo wilaro dwoŋ, kosa wiyumere kicar; to bedi win gi bwonirok i waŋ jowoti win, munyo witero jo paŋini joloyo win gi dwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kisi dhano kwoŋ win wopar kwoŋ gima jowote joyenyo, makiweno gima go ama yenyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paro mewin ripo bedo paka ma Yesu Kristo oyido nitie gine:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liel paka lero i piny",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, wutmera, paka noknok wiwinjo or, ki nyaka ruwaŋan kende, to tektek paka onyo angoye, tiyi win ri both mewin gi lworo kodi kirin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Were ama tiyo i win, ma miyo wiyeyi aka winyal timo atoŋa pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim win gimoro je m'ongoye kiŋunyaŋunya kosa piem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 32:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋey wibedi ma wingoye g'apuse, ma witire paka nyithindho pa Were ma jongoye gi raco i dier luse ji m'okom kendo mareco, ma wiripo liel i dier jo paka micalin ma menyo piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka wicwire i mikwenda ma kwo, aka anobedi g'atoŋa ma yumirok gi win i Ndelo pa Kristo. Kole meno bino nyutho ni tekirok paran je kodi tic k'otho nono!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'onyo cale p'ikonjan woko pa vini m'imedo wi cowirok man kodi tic ma wok i yeyo mewin, je fodi asangala, aka apoko kisangala paran no gi wijoje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno, wibende sangala win aka wipoki kodan siem mewin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Timothe kodi Epafrodito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ageno i Rwoth nike abino dhiro riwin Timothe mayot, ŋey alimi miseni i wac ma kwoŋ win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angoye gi ŋatiman kwanyo woko go, ma bende iy'adieri dewo kwoŋ win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋati man je tho kwoŋ wac pere won, makiweno kwoŋ apa Kristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka wiwegi wiŋeyo paka Timothe otieko nyutho nyalo pere, rupiri paka nyathi gi bamere, go otieko tic kodan kanyacel i fonjo Wac Manyen Maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ageno oro go bongi win, tekin aŋeyo paka gigipiny obedi ran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ageno i Rwoth ni awon abino tundo bongi win mayot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Odoko aparo nike ripo adhiri riwin omin wan Epafrodito bende, m'otieko tic gi lwenyo ruŋetan, aka otieko kiri tic paka jamikwenda mewin i konyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go yenyo swa neno wijoje, aka cunye ramo swa rupiri wiwinjo ni go oyido two. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adieri go oyido two m'oyido cegin tho, to Were mako wor gine; aka ki gi go kende, to gi an bende, ŋey akir'abedi gi litho mathoth i cunyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo ayikere oro go bongi win, ŋey wisangala ka wineno go kendo, to litho ma cunyan mojere woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, joli win go gi kisangala je, paka omin win i Rwoth, odoko wor win ji ma pameno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rupiri go ojala kwo pere, aka oboth'otho ro tic pa Kristo, kendo omiyan kony ma wiwegi di wikinyalo cowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
